{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14036","headline":"送姚校书因归河中 · 耿湋","name":"送姚校书因归河中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十年相见少，一岁又还乡。\n去住人惆怅，东西路渺茫。\n古陂无茂草，高树有残阳。\n委弃秋来稻，雕疎采後桑。\n月轮生舜庙，河水出关墙。\n明日过闾里，光辉芸阁郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14036.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14036","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}